id: R09
target: src/sello/ristretto.nim
desc: ristrettoMap: the s CT_SELECT condition inverted, 'feCMove(s, negAbsSt, not wasSquare)' -> 'feCMove(s, negAbsSt, wasSquare)' -- takes the negated-absolute-value branch exactly when was_square holds (the case RFC 9496 §4.3.4 says to keep the candidate root unchanged) and vice versa. RFC-004 slice 8b's "the map's was_square select flip" target.
====OLD====
  feCMove(s, negAbsSt, not wasSquare)
====NEW====
  feCMove(s, negAbsSt, wasSquare)
====END====
